{"rank": 68, "article": "Charlie Kirk", "revid": 1319799865, "parentid": 1319797316, "user": "BlueShirtz", "timestamp": "2025-10-31T23:08:05Z", "comment": "Replaced infobox image with a higher quality image where Kirk is smiling and his eyes are not staring off to the side. This was also the main image/profile picture he used for his promotional/social media materials, so it more accurately serves as a portrait", "tags": ["wikieditor"], "size": 215982}
